.medusa

# Generated Medusa admin dashboard build output — must be rebuilt on every
# deploy, never committed. A stale committed copy here previously shadowed
# the freshly built admin at ./public/admin, hiding custom widgets/routes.
# Now that the deploy runs `medusa start` from .medusa/server (per Medusa's
# documented production flow), the real build output lives at
# .medusa/server/public/admin, and this path is unused — safe to ignore.
/public/admin